      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "In determining whether the employee has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, where an employee's break in service of more than seven years is occasioned by the fulfillment of a USERRA-covered service obligation (38 U.S.C. 4301 et seq.)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:311e53b64b4f2ad952aed432bea8e4e5304a628f04c015312715a3a8c9e33e20",
      "@type": "rkaf:ValueAssertion",
